# Billing — Tenant access resolution (UC-120)
# The answer the BFF guards read, and the batch read for the rare cross-tenant scan. Tenant-less
# routes under /internal/*, InternalApiGuard only (the tenant is the path parameter). The backend
# answer is the full one (suspension reason and internal markers included); the BFF reduces it.
#
# Prerequisites:
#   1. pnpm infra:up
#   2. pnpm --filter @ikaro/backend run migration:run
#   3. pnpm --filter @ikaro/backend run seed
#   4. pnpm --filter @ikaro/backend run dev
#
# REST Client environment: select "local" in VS Code status bar

@baseUrl     = {{backendUrl}}
@internalKey = {{$dotenv INTERNAL_API_KEY}}
@tenantId    = {{$dotenv SEED_TENANT_ID}}

### One tenant's access: { status, suspensionReason, operational, features }
# Cached 60 s (operational) / 10 s (suspended). `provisional: true` for a tenant under 15 minutes old
# with no subscription yet; `degraded: true` for the uncached fail-open answer.
GET {{baseUrl}}/internal/billing/tenants/{{tenantId}}/access
X-Internal-Key: {{internalKey}}

### Unknown tenant: 404 TENANT_NOT_FOUND (never fail-open)
GET {{baseUrl}}/internal/billing/tenants/00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000000/access
X-Internal-Key: {{internalKey}}

### Missing internal key: 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/internal/billing/tenants/{{tenantId}}/access

### Suspended tenant ids without the internal key: 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/internal/billing/suspended-tenant-ids

### Suspended tenant ids: { tenantIds: [...] }, unpaginated, ids only
GET {{baseUrl}}/internal/billing/suspended-tenant-ids
X-Internal-Key: {{internalKey}}
